									<h3 class="ft25-flip-card__title">Get Sleep Coaching tailored to your needs</h3>
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">Gather your sleep data to receive Sleep Coaching. Wear your Galaxy Watch or Ring while you sleep for a week and discover your Sleep type in the form of an animal. Based on the sleep animal, Samsung Health recommends a custom Sleep Coaching program. Follow your program to foster healthy habits for a better night's rest. <sup>3, 5, 6</sup></div>
