									<h3 class="ft25-flip-card__title">Achieve your best every day with Energy Score</h3>
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">Know your daily readiness with Energy Score. Based on at least the previous day's activities and sleep, you'll receive your Energy Score the next day. If it's lower than expected, check tips for customized advice on where to focus. Aim for a higher Energy Score each day to enhance your overall well-being in the long run. <sup>7</sup></div>
