<div class="pd-g-feature-benefit-half-text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

	
	
	
	<section class="st-feature-benefit-half-text bg-white feature-benefit-half-text--video st-feature-benefit-half-text--left st-feature-benefit-half-text--mo-center st-feature-benefit-half-text--video-layer">
		
		<div class="st-feature-benefit-half-text__content">
			
			<h3 class="st-feature-benefit-half-text__title text-size-medium">How to use Sleep Coaching</h3>
			
			<p class="st-feature-benefit-half-text__description text-size-large">Improve your sleep quality by developing a better sleep routine with Sleep features. Discover your ideal bedtime with Bedtime Guidance to get enough rest for the next day. When enough sleep data has been accumulated, Sleep Coaching recommends a program tailored to your sleep pattern to help you build good sleep habits. <sup>3, 5, 6</sup></p>
			

			
		</div>
		
		<figure class="st-feature-benefit-half-text__figure ">
			
			<div class="st-feature-benefit-half-text__video">
				<div class="st-feature-benefit-half-text__thumbnail">
				    
					<div class="image image--dyn-height">
						<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/apps/samsung-health/25_07/samsung-health-sleep-how-to-pc.jpg?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/apps/samsung-health/25_07/samsung-health-sleep-how-to-mo.jpg?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" alt="Front view of Galaxy Watch8 with Sleep feature notification onscreen. Sleep animal penguin icon is on the left. Text Sleep, number 92 and text Excellent. The same penguin is on the right side of Galaxy Watch8." role="img" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
						<img class="image__main lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/apps/samsung-health/25_07/samsung-health-sleep-how-to-pc.jpg?$FB_TYPE_K_MO_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/apps/samsung-health/25_07/samsung-health-sleep-how-to-mo.jpg?$FB_TYPE_K_MO_PNG$" alt="Front view of Galaxy Watch8 with Sleep feature notification onscreen. Sleep animal penguin icon is on the left. Text Sleep, number 92 and text Excellent. The same penguin is on the right side of Galaxy Watch8." role="img" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
					</div>
				</div>
				<button type="button" class="st-feature-benefit-half-text__btn-play" data-div-id="feature-benefit-half-text-video-container-uniq-id-3706493f-9315-4526-99ed-3bb9dd159722_root_responsivegrid_pd_g_feature_benefit_584370297" an-tr="ft05_half text-apps detail-video-button" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="how to use sleep coaching:play video">
         			<span class="hidden">How to use Sleep Coaching | Galaxy Watch8 Series: Play video</span>
					
       			</button>
       					 
       			<div class="video-area" id="feature-benefit-half-text-video-container-uniq-id-3706493f-9315-4526-99ed-3bb9dd159722_root_responsivegrid_pd_g_feature_benefit_584370297">
		           <div class="video-area__inner">
		               <div class="video" data-image-default="false" data-video-embed="false" data-video-type="youtube" data-video-data='{
				           "id": "8zp9OUxCYNU",
				           "title": "How to use Sleep Coaching | Galaxy Watch8 Series",
				           "caption": "Text in the middle: How to sleep better with Galaxy Watch8. New text appears: Want to wake up fully recharged? New text appears: Build healthy sleep habits with your watch. New text appears: Let&#39;s get started. Scene changes, text appears at the top: First, pair your watch with your phone. Galaxy Watch8 and smartphone appear from left and right. New text appears: Tap &#39;Connect&#39;. Galaxy Watch8 screen displays text Welcome and smartphone screen displays a popup with Galaxy Watch8 turning 360 degrees. Text Galaxy Watch8, A new device has been detected. At the bottom are buttons Cancel and Connect. Connect button is tapped. Sequences shortened. Galaxy S25 Ultra sold separately. Video simulated for illustrative purposes. Actual UI may be different. Galaxy Watch8 Series or later must be paired with a smartphone with Android 11.0 or above and minimum 1.5 gigabyte Memory. Scene changes, text in the middle: Let&#39;s find your optimal bedtime. Scene changes, text in the middle: Track your sleep for 1 nights in a row. 1 nights goes up to 3 nights and 3 moon icons above are marked to indicate 3 nights have passed. Bedtime Guidance is available on Android phones (Android 11 and above) and requires Samsung Health app (v6.30.2 or above). Samsung account login required. Bedtime Guidance is based on 3 days of sleep analysis of user&#39;s circadian rhythm and sleep pressure. Sleep features are intended for general wellness and fitness purposes only. Not intended for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition or sleep disorder. The measurements are for your personal reference only. Please consult a medical professional for advice. Sleep tracking requires wearing Galaxy Watch or Galaxy Ring to sleep. Scene changes, text on the left: This process helps establish your baseline. On the right is Galaxy Watch8 with Bedtime Guidance onscreen, showing Sleep time and Actual sleep time data for each night. Video simulated for illustrative purposes. Actual UX/UI may be different. Bedtime Guidance is available on Android phones (Android 11 and above) and requires Samsung Health app (v6.30.2 or above). Samsung account login required. Bedtime Guidance is based on 3 days of sleep analysis of user&#39;s circadian rhythm and sleep pressure. Sleep features are intended for general wellness and fitness purposes only. Not intended for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition or sleep disorder. The measurements are for your personal reference only. Please consult a medical professional for advice. Sleep tracking requires wearing Galaxy Watch or Galaxy Ring to sleep. Scene changes, text on the left: Now let&#39;s start setting up Bedtime Guidance. On the right is smartphone with Samsung Health onscreen. On the left, new text appears: On Samsung Health home, tap &#39;Sleep score&#39;. On the smartphone, Sleep score part is tapped. Sleep feature is onscreen. On the left, new text appears: Go to &#39;More&#39; and tap &#39;Bedtime guidance&#39;. On the smartphone, More menu is tapped. Then, Bedtime guidance is selected. Bedtime guidance feature is onscreen. On the left, new text appears: or you can tap the card. On the smartphone, Sleep feature is onscreen and the card at the top is tapped. Bedtime guidance feature is onscreen. On the left, new text appears: to check your ideal bedtime. New text appears: Set your wake-up time. On the smartphone, Set wake-up time is tapped. Set wake-up time popup appears and time is selected to 6 AM. Buttons Cancel and Done are at the bottom. Done button is tapped. On the left, new text appears: and you&#39;ll see your recommended bedtime. On the smartphone, Recommended bedtime window section is enlarged, with bedtime set to Tonight 10:10 PM to 10:40 PM. On the left, new text appears: Enable &#39;Bedtime notifications&#39;. On the smartphone, screen is scrolled down and Bedtime notifications section is enlarged. Text Get notified when your recommended bedtime is approaching. Toggle button is turned on. Scene changes, text at the top: to get notified when it&#39;s time to wind down. Galaxy Watch8 and smartphone are side by side in the middle. The same Bedtime guidance alert appears on both devices. Samsung Health logo and text Bedtime guidance, time 8:10 PM, text Try going to sleep between 10:10 PM and 10:40 PM tonight. Galaxy S25 Ultra sold separately. Video simulated for illustrative purposes. Actual UI may be different. Bedtime Guidance is available on Android phones (Android 11 and above) and requires Samsung Health app (v6.30.2 or above). Samsung account login required. Bedtime Guidance is based on 3 days of sleep analysis of user&#39;s circadian rhythm and sleep pressure. Sleep features are intended for general wellness and fitness purposes only. Not intended for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition or sleep disorder. The measurements are for your personal reference only. Please consult a medical professional for advice. Scene changes, text in the middle: Want to improve sleep quality through a tailored program? New text appears: Track your sleep for 1 days, including 1 workday and 1 day off. 1 days goes up to 7 days and 7 moon icons above are marked to indicate 7 nights have passed. New text appears: Then, you&#39;ll discover your sleep animal. The moon icons above change to sleep animals. An eighth animal, the penguin, is added to the right. Available on Samsung Health app v6.24 or above and must be paired with Samsung Galaxy smartphones with Android OS 11 and above. Samsung account login required. Requires sleep data of at least 7 days (including 1 workday and 1 day off). Sleep features are intended for general wellness and fitness purposes only. Not inteded for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition or sleep disorder. The measurements are for your personal reference only. Please consult a medical professional for advice. Sleep tracking requires wearing Galaxy Watch or Galaxy Ring to sleep. Scene changes, text on the left: Look, you&#39;re a penguin! On the right is Galaxy Watch8 displaying Sleep feature notification with penguin icon and text Sleep, 92, Excellent. On the left, new text appears: You can view sleep data, detailed analysis. The notification on Galaxy Watch8 is tapped. Moon icon, number 92 with triangle and number 3 on the right to indicate the sleep score increased by 3 points. Text Excellent and sleep time 7 hours and 30 minutes. The screen is scrolled down to the bottom. Galaxy Watch8 displays penguin, text Check your habits, and View all button. On the left, new text appears: and check sleep habits. The button on Galaxy Watch8 is tapped. Sleep coaching feature is onscreen. The screen is scrolled down to the bottom. Galaxy Watch8 displays Show on phone button. On the left, new text appears: Tap &#39;Show on phone&#39;. The button on Galaxy Watch8 is tapped. Video simulated for illustrative purposes. Actual UX/UI may be different. Available on Samsung Health app v6.24 or above and must be paired with Samsung Galaxy smartphones with Android OS 11 and above. Samsung account login required. Required sleep data of at least 7 days (including 1 workday and 1 day off). Intended for general wellness and fitness purposes only. Not inteded for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition or disease. Please consult a medical professional for advice. Scene changes, smartphone is on the right with Sleep coaching feature onscreen. On the left, text for more details. Screen on smartphone is scrolled down and displays More good habits section, with some good habits checked as done. On the left, new text appears: After 3 to 4 weeks, check how your sleep quality has improved. Screen on smartphone displays Sleep analysis feature and is scrolled down. Sequences shortened. Galaxy S25 Ultra sold separately. Video simulated for illustrative purposes. Actual UX/UI may be different. Available on Samsung Health app v6.24 or above and must be paired with Samsung Galaxy smartphones with Android OS 11 and above. Samsung account login required. Required sleep data of at least 7 days (including 1 workday and 1 day off). Intended for general wellness and fitness purposes only. Not inteded for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition or disease. Please consult a medical professional for advice. Scene changes, text appears in the middle: Get better rest for tomorrow with Galaxy Watch. Scene changes. Galaxy Watch8 Classic is on its side and is slightly turned. Galaxy Watch8 appears in a slightly tilted front view and is placed next to Galaxy Watch8 Classic. Text Galaxy Watch8 Watch8 Classic. Scene changes. In the middle, samsung.com. Samsung logo.",
						   "muted": false,
				           "autoplay": false
				        }'>
