									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">Take your cycling skills to the next level. Set up your own route by importing a pre-set file in GPX format to your Galaxy Watch and connect a power meter to your smartphone to measure your Functional Threshold Power (FTP). Now you're all set — pedal your way to maximum performance and check your progress on Samsung Health. <sup>9, 10</sup></div>
