									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">Get optimal results by keeping an eye on your swimming data. Your swimming stroke and swim split time are automatically measured as well as your average pace, average speed and more. With this extensive data, get a comprehensive analysis of your workout. It'll help you be ready for advanced-level swims in a flash.</div>
