									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">See how well you're aging by simply placing your thumb on the sensor. By measuring the carotenoids — an antioxidant that builds up in the skin when you consume fruits and vegetables — Samsung Health provides Antioxidant Index with a score from 0 to 100. Keep track of your score and if is continues to stay low, try sticking to a well-balanced diet to slow down the effects of aging. <sup>13, 14, 15, 16</sup></div>
