                    <p class="st-feature-benefit-full-bleed__eyebrow-text">Vital sign / Heart Health</p>
                    
                        <h2 class="st-feature-benefit-full-bleed__title" data-font-size-pc="48" data-font-size-mo="30">Be on top of your heart health</h2>
                        
                    
                    
                    <p class="st-feature-benefit-full-bleed__text" data-font-size-pc="18" data-font-size-mo="14">Observe heart activities for overall health with Galaxy Watch. Then, Samsung Health Monitor along with Samsung Health will provide valuable insights. Keep your heart in good condition seamlessly.</p>
                    
                    
